id: pm-gh1475
title: "GH-1475: settle authenticated lossless merges within one reviewed delivery"
description: Published 2026.10.14 losslessly merges disjoint scalar edits and union collections but leaves a pending receipt and gate-failing health until explicit reconcile plus a second commit. Evaluate a complete audited settlement path that preserves existing evidence authentication and genuine conflicting-value review requirements.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-14T22:04:28.563Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T20:33:35.971Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-18T20:33:34.663Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-18T20:33:34.663Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce the submitted fresh Git merge on the immutable published artifact and candidate; preserve both branch values and history; validate authenticated no-discard settlement and fresh-clone receipt portability; prove same-field conflicts, lossy decisions, malformed or unsealed legacy evidence remain review-required; retain SDK/CLI parity and non-surprising opt-in hook behavior; do not weaken health or verification merely to suppress a pending state."
parent: pm-dj98
risk: high
confidence: medium
severity: medium
resolution: "SDK guarded settlement uses bounded indexed-object batches without clone-local replacement interpretation, and binds preview, verification, apply and staging to one physical tracker context. Existing schema/provenance checks, visible identity refusal and operator staging protections remain intact. Public SDK, CLI/MCP contracts, packed consumers and historical recovery fixtures share the portable proof boundary."
expected_result: "Portable audit authority reads actual indexed object bytes across tracker aliases and clone-local Git replacement configuration, without losing branch context or unrelated operator staging."
actual_result: "Final120-case receipt/staging/batch coverage is exact100/100/100/100:381 statements,293 branches,78 functions,320 lines. The real replacement-ref control failed before the fix and passes afterward while preserving the ref. Bun1.4.3 completes one public alias merge commit and leaves a healthy fresh clone. All4 linked commands and4 TypeScript projects pass; source/contract/assurance, mutation and9-package packed smoke admission was verified in the same reviewed delivery. The complete local run had10713 passes,3 timeouts and3 platform skips, with all3 affected cases passing unchanged limits in smaller runs. Qualified local import/transport timing failures are retained; final hosted timing, whole-source/native coverage and full available review remain merge conditions."
